    content: `<h2>Our Community Standards</h2><p>MiloBolo is built on a simple principle: treat every stranger with the same respect you would want to receive. Our community guidelines are an extension of this principle into specific, actionable rules.</p><h2>What Is Always Allowed</h2><ul><li>Friendly conversation on any appropriate topic</li><li>Language practice and cultural exchange</li><li>Sharing opinions respectfully, including controversial ones</li><li>Using reactions and expressions freely</li><li>Ending conversations at any time for any reason</li></ul><h2>What Is Never Allowed</h2><ul><li>Nudity or sexual content of any kind</li><li>Harassment, threats, or hate speech based on any characteristic</li><li>Any content involving minors in any sexual or exploitative context</li><li>Spam, bots, or automated connections</li><li>Attempting to obtain personal information through pressure or manipulation</li><li>Impersonation of MiloBolo staff or other users</li></ul><h2>Consequences</h2><p>Violations result in temporary or permanent bans depending on severity. Serious violations involving illegal content are reported to relevant authorities. We take every report seriously.</p>`,
